WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.969
-Guys, like I said,
the Super Bowl is this Sunday

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.237
and, man, it's going
to be a good one.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.271
You got the
Tampa Bay Buccaneers

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.605
taking on the
Kansas City Chiefs.

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:09.843
You got Brady versus Mahomes,
Kelce versus "Gronk."

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.844
Both teams are so great,
it's nearly impossible

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.346
to predict
who's going to win.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.815
But you're in luck, because when
it comes to predicting things,

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.317
we have a secret weapon,
and it's puppies.

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:19.419
That's right --
ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.919
it is time for the
"Puppy Predictors,"

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.322
Super Bowl LV edition!

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:27.393
-♪ "Puppy Predictors" ♪

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:31.831
♪ "Puppy Predictors" ♪

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:32.966 line:0%
-Alright, here's how it works.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.568
We have one bowl
of delicious kibble

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.204
and two adorable puppies --
one representing the Bucs,

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.273
the other representing
the Chiefs.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.408
Now, let's meet the puppies.

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:48.581
♪♪

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.182
Hey. Hey.

00:00:50.182 --> 00:00:52.285
That is -- Hey.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.989
Hey. That is rude.

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.991
Gary, Gary, don't put
your back towards me.

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:02.061
Gary. Thank you, buddy.
I appreciate it. Thank you.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.362
There they are.

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:04.830
First, we have Ron Bell

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.399
representing the Chiefs.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
Ron.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.804
And then he'll be taking
on Gary Frick Jr.,

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.073
representing the Bucs.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:15.341
All right, guys,
before I release you,

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:16.809
I need you to listen up, okay?

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:20.479
No. Hey, Ron, guys,
this is a competition.

00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:22.114
Gary, wake up. Let's go.

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:25.551
Now, look, no wandering.
Thank you for paying attention.

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.487
No peeing,
no butt-sniffing, okay?

00:01:28.487 --> 00:01:31.524
This is professional.
This is a professional game.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.493
We want to see who wins
the Super Bowl.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.461
Okay, here we go.
Get ready to go.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.630
Alright, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.998
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:42.501
Okay, now to predict who's
going to win Super Bowl LV,

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.103
here are the puppies.

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:45.938
Release the puppies.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:51.010
♪♪

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.244
No, no, no, no.
Absolutely not.

00:01:52.244 --> 00:01:53.880
No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.681
No, guys. Absolutely --

00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:59.285
Oh, yep, it's a tight game.
They're back in the game.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:02.055 line:0%
Here they -- It's going to be
the Buccaneers!

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.590 line:0%
[ Dinging ]

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:07.693 line:0%
You did it! You did it, Gary!
Good job!

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:11.029 line:0%
Congratulations to
the Super Bowl champs,

00:02:11.029 --> 00:02:14.234 line:0%
the Tampa Bay Buccaneers.

